# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Same as clip-512d-euclidean, but use the Cosine distance metric, which
# results in increased accuracy.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
new-index dataset=clip-512d-1050.gob train-count=1000 min-partition-size=4 max-partition-size=16 quality-samples=8 beam-size=4 distance-metric=Cosine
----
Created index with 1000 vectors with 512 dimensions.

recall topk=10 beam-size=1 samples=20
